cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GenoToolBoxPlus"
abstract: >
  GenoToolBoxPlus is a collection of lightweight, zero-dependency Python CLI
  utilities for genomics and genome annotation tasks, grouped into
  FASTA_Utilities, GenomicData_Download, GFF_Utilities, and
  ThirdPartyTool_Utilities. Scripts include FASTA renaming and statistics,
  GFA-to-FASTA conversion, NCBI genome/annotation download, GWH-header-based
  SeqID renaming, systematic GFF3 gene-model renaming, EarlGrey TE FASTA
  extraction, GFF3-to-BED conversion for OrthoVennPlus, and AHRD
  functional-annotation config generation from GAQET runs. Each script uses
  the Python standard library only and runs in any Python 3.10+ environment
  without conda.
